###words are Light

mad writing this am. it's the only way, telling myself my story over and over again to shine light into every fuckin' crevice so that nothing remains in shadow, and all can bask in All Love.

i may not have the power to Love, but i have the power to be Light, and illuminate everywhere i go.

a pledge for today.

bless,
b


